From: openSUSE Publishing <publishing@opensuse.org>
Subject: [PATCH] Drop unused egui patch pins so the offline vendor build resolves
Bug: none (downstream build fix, not upstreamable)

Upstream pins three egui crates (egui_demo_lib, egui_inspection,
egui_system_font_provider) in [patch.crates-io] that nothing in the
workspace uses (Cargo.lock lists all three under [[patch.unused]]).
cargo_vendor therefore omits them from vendor-cratesio.tar.zst, and any
--offline/--locked resolve against the vendor directory fails with
"patch location ... does not contain packages matching egui_demo_lib".
Drop the three unused pins (plus their [[patch.unused]] lock stanzas,
so --locked stays satisfied); the [[package]] set is unchanged
(egui_extras stays: crates/ui-egui uses it, so its pin is retained,
unlike in filmcraft where it was unused too).
--- a/Cargo.toml
+++ b/Cargo.toml
@@ -143,8 +143,5 @@
 egui_glow = { git = "https://github.com/storytold/egui.git", rev = "6d518fc799681571963842f95b55a6b68431b15a" }
 egui_extras = { git = "https://github.com/storytold/egui.git", rev = "6d518fc799681571963842f95b55a6b68431b15a" }
 egui_kittest = { git = "https://github.com/storytold/egui.git", rev = "6d518fc799681571963842f95b55a6b68431b15a" }
-egui_system_font_provider = { git = "https://github.com/storytold/egui.git", rev = "6d518fc799681571963842f95b55a6b68431b15a" }
 eframe = { git = "https://github.com/storytold/egui.git", rev = "6d518fc799681571963842f95b55a6b68431b15a" }
-egui_demo_lib = { git = "https://github.com/storytold/egui.git", rev = "6d518fc799681571963842f95b55a6b68431b15a" }
-egui_inspection = { git = "https://github.com/storytold/egui.git", rev = "6d518fc799681571963842f95b55a6b68431b15a" }
 winit = { git = "https://github.com/storytold/winit.git", rev = "a517b3846ee8457d84ee4975110bfda6797c44dc" }
--- a/Cargo.lock
+++ b/Cargo.lock
@@ -8690,17 +8690,3 @@
  "winnow",
 ]
 
-[[patch.unused]]
-name = "egui_demo_lib"
-version = "0.37.0"
-source = "git+https://github.com/storytold/egui.git?rev=6d518fc799681571963842f95b55a6b68431b15a#6d518fc799681571963842f95b55a6b68431b15a"
-
-[[patch.unused]]
-name = "egui_inspection"
-version = "0.37.0"
-source = "git+https://github.com/storytold/egui.git?rev=6d518fc799681571963842f95b55a6b68431b15a#6d518fc799681571963842f95b55a6b68431b15a"
-
-[[patch.unused]]
-name = "egui_system_font_provider"
-version = "0.37.0"
-source = "git+https://github.com/storytold/egui.git?rev=6d518fc799681571963842f95b55a6b68431b15a#6d518fc799681571963842f95b55a6b68431b15a"
